<title>POLAND: Polish unemployment falls to 13.4 pct in February.</title>
<headline>Polish unemployment falls to 13.4 pct in February.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Registered unemployment in Poland fell to 13.4 percent of the workforce in February from 13.5 percent in January, figures from the Central Statistical Office (GUS) showed on Monday.  </p>
<p> POLISH UNEMPLOYMENT	FEBRUARY    JANUARY	FEB 1996</p>
<p> number of jobless million  2.312	2.336	   2.734</p>
<p> pct of workforce	    13.4	 13.5	    15.5</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
